sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as Owner (out of band)
  participant P as Phone app
  participant C as Cloudflare tunnel or relay
  participant S as Servant server
  participant H as Claude Code (localhost)
  O->>P: Trusted invite: code + server public key
  Note left of P: Pin public key in SecureStore
  P->>C: POST /v1/secure {ephemeral key, salt, ciphertext} pair request
  C->>S: forwards opaque envelope
  Note right of S: ECDH + HKDF, decrypt, check time and replay
  Note right of S: Hash invite code, match, issue device token (stored as SHA-256)
  S-->>P: Encrypted frames: device token
  Note over P,S: Every later request: new ephemeral key + salt, bearer token inside ciphertext
  P->>C: POST /v1/secure (message to agent)
  C->>S: opaque envelope (no bearer token visible)
  Note right of S: Authorize device, role, conversation access
  Note right of S: Store plaintext message (records copy if enabled)
  S->>H: prompt + history (owner or member profile)
  H-->>S: streamed reply
  S-->>P: Encrypted, sequenced response frames (headers, chunks, end)
  Note over C: Sees sizes, timing, IPs only
